## Phase 9: Test End-to-End

Push a code change — pipeline triggers automatically:

```bash
cd ~/python-flask-app
sed -i 's/Version: 1.0/Version: 2.0/' templates/index.html
git add .
git commit -m "Update to version 2.0"
git push origin main
```

Watch CodePipeline:
1. ✅ Source → Pulls from CodeCommit
2. ✅ Build → Builds Docker image, pushes to ECR
3. ✅ Deploy → Updates ECS service with new image

Refresh browser — page shows "Version: 2.0" ✅

