## Traffic Flow

```
Browser (HTTPS:443)
    ↓
ALB (TLS termination — uses ACM cert)
    ↓
Target Group (HTTP:8080)
    ↓
ECS Fargate Container (Flask on port 8080)
    ↓
Response back to browser
```

---

## Common Mistakes to Avoid

| Mistake | Consequence | Correct Setting |
|---------|-------------|-----------------|
| Target group protocol: HTTPS | 504 timeout | Use **HTTP** |
| Target group port: 443 | ALB sends to wrong port | Use **8080** |
| Health check protocol: HTTPS | Targets always unhealthy | Use **HTTP** |
| Certificate without FQDN | ALB rejects cert | Use `app.example.com` format |
| CodeBuild without Privileged | Docker build fails | Enable Privileged ✅ |
| Image definitions typo | Deploy fails | `imagedefinitions.json` (exact spelling) |
| ECS tasks without public IP | Tasks can't pull images | Enable public IP |

