## Cleanup (Delete All Resources)

```bash
# Delete pipeline
aws codepipeline delete-pipeline --name flask-app-pipeline --region us-west-2

# Delete CodeBuild project
aws codebuild delete-project --name flask-app-build --region us-west-2

# Delete ECS service
aws ecs update-service --cluster python-flask-cluster --service flask-service --desired-count 0 --region us-west-2
aws ecs delete-service --cluster python-flask-cluster --service flask-service --force --region us-west-2

# Delete ECS cluster
aws ecs delete-cluster --cluster python-flask-cluster --region us-west-2

# Delete ALB, target groups, listeners (via console or CLI)
# Delete security groups
# Delete ECR repository
aws ecr delete-repository --repository-name python-flask-app --force --region us-west-2

# Delete CodeCommit repo
aws codecommit delete-repository --repository-name python-flask-app --region us-west-2

# Delete IAM roles (detach policies first)
# Delete ACM certificate
# Delete CloudWatch log group
aws logs delete-log-group --log-group-name /ecs/python-flask-app --region us-west-2
```
